' Use cases as they stand at sprint 4. ../Archive/use-case-diagram-planned.puml is the planned scope
' and is left untouched: this file says what a reader can actually do today (16.10.2026).
'
' Differences with the planned scope:
'   - "Enregistrement automatique dernier filtre" is gone. The feature was dropped and its two
'     tables (filters, users_has_last_filters) are no longer created by any script. The last
'     search is kept a day in the browser instead.
'   - "Modification sources personnalisées" is implemented, and split: one list of every source
'     (found for the profile, added, left out), a site added by hand, a search of the directory and
'     of the web, a file of sites imported, the media a search was missing, the sources recommended,
'     a source trusted (star), removed, brought back, or kept against the thumbs.
'   - "Enregistrement" is implemented: the account is created with its profile, written by the AI
'     from its questions, and only while the server opens the signup (SIGNUP_OPEN=1).
'   - The account: username, e-mail and password, each changed with the current password.
'   - The briefing and the profile are new: the AI reads interests in what the reader writes, and
'     chooses the stories of the briefing among the closest to them. Since sprint 3: a window of 1
'     to 7 days on a bar, 10, 20 or 30 cards, three ways of reading (bullet points, summary, key
'     passages, always the article's own sentences), the AI version of the points and the summary on
'     demand, the AI analysis of the cards that need one, the official sources, the other angles.
'   - A profile has its language, its projects for a time, and what it follows (Wikidata items,
'     names and words as written), each with a page of its news. A member renames, switches and
'     deletes their profiles; only an administrator writes another one (15 at most).
'   - "Résumer les nouvelles" became the key passages: the article's own sentences, chosen by the AI.
'   - "Abonnement newsletter" became the e-mail of the briefing, sent on demand by an administrator
'     (no subscription). "View member information" and "Monitor member activity" are not
'     implemented: what the administrators can do is send the e-mail (with a news added by its link,
'     the pictures chosen) and write other profiles (server: services/utils/admin.js; the client
'     hides it from the others: GET /briefing answers mail, GET /session answers admin).
'   - The thumbs of a card are votes; there is no "seen" mark: a story counts as read only once it
'     was sent by e-mail.
'
' Two pages, to stay legible (one was over 4000 px high): the account, the profiles and the sources
' (use-case-diagram.png), then the search, the briefing, its e-mail and what is followed
' (use-case-diagram_001.png).

@startuml
title Diagramme Use Case - NewsGenerator Sprint 4 (16.10.2026) - compte, profils, sources
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Invité" as g
actor "Membre" as m #LightBlue
actor "Administrateur" as a #LightGreen

rectangle "NewsGenerator System" {
    package "Compte" {
        usecase "Se connecter" as login
        usecase "Créer un compte avec son profil\n(inscription ouverte)" as register #LightBlue
        usecase "Se déconnecter" as logout
        usecase "Changer son nom d'utilisateur" as changeName #LightBlue
        usecase "Changer son e-mail" as changeEmail #LightBlue
        usecase "Changer son mot de passe" as changePassword #LightBlue
        usecase "Confirmer avec son mot de passe actuel" as confirm #LightBlue
    }

    package "Profils" {
        usecase "Écrire son profil" as profile #LightBlue
        usecase "Répondre aux questions de l'IA" as funnel #LightBlue
        usecase "Corriger ses intérêts\n(texte, principal / secondaire, retirer)" as interests #LightBlue
        usecase "Choisir la langue du profil" as chooseLanguage #LightBlue
        usecase "Renommer le profil" as renameProfile #LightBlue
        usecase "Changer de profil" as switchProfile #LightBlue
        usecase "Supprimer un profil" as deleteProfile #LightBlue
        usecase "Créer un autre profil" as newProfile #LightGreen
        usecase "Ajouter un projet\n(et changer son dernier jour, le retirer)" as project #LightBlue
        note "Intérêts, sources, projets et\nbriefings sont propres à chaque\nprofil. Plusieurs profils: les\nadministrateurs (15 au plus)" as profilesNote
    }

    package "Sources" {
        usecase "Voir toutes ses sources\n(trouvées, ajoutées, laissées de côté)" as listSources #LightBlue
        usecase "Chercher plus de sources" as rediscover #LightBlue
        usecase "Ajouter un site" as addSource
        usecase "Chercher une source\n(annuaire et web)" as searchSource #LightBlue
        usecase "Importer un fichier de sites" as importFile #LightBlue
        usecase "Ajouter une source recommandée" as recommended #LightBlue
        usecase "Marquer une source de confiance" as trust #LightBlue
        usecase "Retirer une source" as deleteSource
        usecase "Rétablir une source retirée\nou laissée de côté" as restore #LightBlue
    }
}


'invité
g --> login
g --> register

'membre
g <|-- m
m --> logout
m --> changeName
m --> changeEmail
m --> changePassword
m --> profile
m --> interests
m --> renameProfile
m --> switchProfile
m --> deleteProfile
m --> project
m --> listSources
m --> rediscover
m --> addSource
m --> searchSource
m --> importFile
m --> recommended
m --> trust
m --> deleteSource
m --> restore

'administrateur
m <|-- a
a --> newProfile

register ..> profile : <<include>>
profile ..> chooseLanguage : <<include>>
funnel ..> profile : <<extend>>
newProfile ..> profile : <<include>>
project ..> funnel : <<include>>
changeName ..> confirm : <<include>>
changeEmail ..> confirm : <<include>>
changePassword ..> confirm : <<include>>

newpage
title Diagramme Use Case - NewsGenerator Sprint 4 (16.10.2026) - recherche, briefing, e-mail, suivi
left to right direction

actor "Membre" as m2 #LightBlue
actor "Administrateur" as a2 #LightGreen

rectangle "NewsGenerator System " {
    package "Rechercher" {
        usecase "Rechercher par une phrase\nou des mots exacts" as searchNews
        usecase "Élargir la recherche quand elle trouve peu" as widen #LightBlue
        usecase "Filtrer les résultats" as filter #LightBlue
        usecase "Voir la reprise d'une nouvelle\n(médias et formulations)" as corroboration #LightBlue
        usecase "Voir les faits d'une affaire" as thread #LightBlue
        usecase "Lire les passages clés\ndes nouvelles choisies (IA)" as passages
        usecase "Lire les traductions" as translate #LightBlue
        usecase "Voir les médias manquants à sa recherche" as seeMissing #LightBlue
        usecase "Ajouter les sources suggérées" as importSources #LightBlue
        usecase "Retrouver sa dernière recherche (un jour)" as kept #LightBlue
        usecase "Sauvegarder une recherche\n(nouvelle ou remplacée)" as saveSearch
        usecase "Charger une recherche sauvegardée" as listSearches
        usecase "Supprimer une recherche sauvegardée" as deleteSearch
    }

    package "Briefing" {
        usecase "Écrire un nouveau briefing" as briefing #LightBlue
        usecase "Choisir la période (1 à 7 jours)" as period #LightBlue
        usecase "Choisir le nombre de cartes\n(10, 20, 30)" as size #LightBlue
        usecase "Lire son briefing" as read #LightBlue
        usecase "Choisir la forme\n(points, résumé, passages clés)" as format #LightBlue
        usecase "Voir la version IA" as aiVersion #LightBlue
        usecase "Lire l'analyse IA" as analysis #LightBlue
        usecase "Voir les sources officielles,\nles démentis, les autres angles" as asides #LightBlue
        usecase "Lire les traductions " as translate2 #LightBlue
        usecase "Voter pour une histoire" as vote #LightBlue
        usecase "Ajouter une nouvelle par son lien" as addNews #LightGreen
    }

    package "E-mail du briefing" {
        usecase "Envoyer des histoires par e-mail" as email #LightGreen
        usecase "Cocher les histoires" as tick #LightGreen
        usecase "Choisir l'adresse" as to #LightGreen
        usecase "Changer l'ordre" as order #LightGreen
        usecase "Changer le titre" as mailTitle #LightGreen
        usecase "Choisir l'image" as picture #LightGreen
        usecase "Envoyer la version IA" as sendAi #LightGreen
        usecase "Retirer des lignes (analyse, démentis,\nangles, sources officielles)" as removeLines #LightGreen
    }

    package "Suivre" {
        usecase "Suivre un club, une personne,\nune organisation (Wikidata)" as follow #LightBlue
        usecase "Suivre un nom ou un mot tel qu'écrit" as followWord #LightBlue
        usecase "Suivre un nom suggéré" as suggested #LightBlue
        usecase "Voir ce qu'on suit dans le briefing" as watched #LightBlue
        usecase "Ouvrir la page d'un nom\n(ses nouvelles et ses liens)" as entityPage #LightBlue
        usecase "Changer les noms d'un élément" as names #LightBlue
    }
}

note right of corroboration
    Décrit ce qui a été mesuré,
    jamais si la nouvelle est vraie.
end note

note right of passages
    Les phrases de l'article,
    l'IA ne fait que les choisir.
end note

note right of email
    Une histoire envoyée compte comme lue:
    les briefings des 48 h suivantes la laissent
    de côté, sauf si du nouveau est arrivé.
end note

'membre
m2 --> searchNews
m2 --> passages
m2 --> seeMissing
m2 --> kept
m2 --> saveSearch
m2 --> listSearches
m2 --> deleteSearch
m2 --> briefing
m2 --> read
m2 --> vote
m2 --> follow
m2 --> followWord
m2 --> entityPage

'administrateur
m2 <|-- a2
a2 --> addNews
a2 --> email

searchNews ..> corroboration : <<include>>
translate ..> searchNews : <<extend>>
thread ..> searchNews : <<extend>>
widen ..> searchNews : <<extend>>
filter ..> searchNews : <<extend>>
importSources ..> seeMissing : <<extend>>
briefing ..> period : <<include>>
briefing ..> size : <<include>>
format ..> read : <<extend>>
aiVersion ..> read : <<extend>>
analysis ..> read : <<extend>>
asides ..> read : <<extend>>
translate2 ..> read : <<extend>>
watched ..> read : <<extend>>
email ..> tick : <<include>>
email ..> to : <<include>>
order ..> email : <<extend>>
mailTitle ..> email : <<extend>>
picture ..> email : <<extend>>
sendAi ..> email : <<extend>>
removeLines ..> email : <<extend>>
names ..> entityPage : <<extend>>
suggested ..> follow : <<extend>>

@enduml
